- `action(n1, "start")`: Hallucinates a generic initialization step not present in the description; the source explicitly states "the first step is to check the SLA." (SMC1)
- `actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, b1, n3, n4, n5, e1, c1])`: Assigns responsibility to "Default" instead of the "Admin Office" specified in the source text. (SMC7)
- `action(n5, "End of process")`: Misrepresents the concluding milestone as a discrete executable task, whereas the source treats it as a terminal state ("This marks the end of the process."). (SMC1/SMC2)